   "text": "- The agent never approves and never skips a stage.\n- Writes only after the named Owner, then Security, approve;\n  re-checked before every write; each write switch off until approved.\n- Never assigns Owner, Contributor, User Access Admin or other admin roles.\n- TAP and passwords masked (******) in logs, mail and prompts.\n- Acts only in its own Entra tenant; for another tenant the teams do it.\n- Cost: free tiers + one Flex worker; budget INR 2,000 a month.",
